{"resourceIdentifier":"5324","resourceName":"Sembrando Futuro Restoration Project","description":"The Sembrando Futuro project is an initiative that promotes the ecological restoration and conservation of ecosystems such as tropical dry forests, and Andean forests. By restoring these ecosystems, the project supports biodiversity but also aligns with global climate change mitigation efforts.\r\nFundación Argos has designed a comprehensive intervention model based on achieving several components. These include contributing to sustainable development goals, driving the company towards carbon neutrality, and preserving the country's ecosystems. Restoration and conservation activities are made possible through conservation agreements with private landowners, which allow for reforestation and ecological rehabilitation.The project is expected to deliver significant climate benefits, with an average annual greenhouse gas removal of 11,673 tCO₂e and a total removal of 478,587 tCO₂e over the crediting period (40 years). These carbon reductions will contribute to Colombia's national efforts to address climate change and improve the sustainability of natural landscapes.","location":{"latitude":5.586711,"longitude":-75.748611},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5324"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Sonson"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Fundación Grupo Argos"},{"type":"string","value":"Antioquia, Colombia"},{"type":"string","value":"+57 3106722183"},{"type":"string","value":"jose.guerrero@grupoargos.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Withdrawn"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"10740"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"VM0047"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"87574 Hectares"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 30/10/2021 - 29/10/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=125026&IDKEY=8iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3l172410854","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Template-v4.4_SembrandoFuturo_rev.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-12-23T13:38:15.157Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=125212&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk172667348","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Listing-Representation-Single-PP-v4.2 ARGOSrev.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-12-27T15:12:31.96Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_OTHER_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Other Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=125680&IDKEY=h0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9s173312720","documentType":"Communications Agreement","documentName":"Verra-Registry-Communications-Agreement-single-PP_V03.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-01-07T10:58:07.15Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=121483&IDKEY=2kjalskjf098234kj28098sfkjlf098098kl32lasjdflkj9092167525057","documentType":"KML File","documentName":"AP_SembrandoFuturo.kml","uploadDate":"2024-10-30T19:22:37.06Z"}]}],"childResources":[]}